self.KB_CONTENT["card:779040"]={"id":"card:779040","ty":"card","sourceId":"779040","title":"『出貨通知單建立作業(IDL)』中的『發票地址一 (TA014)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"客戶","keywords":["客戶","發票","出貨","地址"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可空白。* 可點選 (icon)或[F2]客戶地址代號查詢(COPMD-01)，預設發票地址、發票地址一。* [F3]地址資料查詢。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:779264"]={"id":"card:779264","ty":"card","sourceId":"779264","title":"『轉撥單憑證(IDL)(IDLR18)』中的『選擇FAX/Email傳送狀態 (C 1)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"憑證","keywords":["憑證","狀態","傳送","轉撥"],"y":"other","answer":"* 尚未購買『FAX/Email處理系統』(FEP)，則FAX/Email需隱藏。* 分為Y.已傳送、N.未傳送及全部三種傳送狀態。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
